00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,400
More sensors don't automatically mean better tracking.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:10,800
Add a camera. The track looks better.

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:18,800
Scored across many runs, it is mostly worse.
Precision: worse in 14 scenarios, better in 0, unclear in 1.

4
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:26,800
A small camera bias can be estimated and partly fixed.
Scenario: sensor_disagreement_within_gate_high
Bias estimation recovers 45% of fused's precision loss.

